[{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0034","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0034.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-8611","title":"Microsoft Windows 内核特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 内核在处理内存对象时存在管理缺陷，导致特权提升漏洞。攻击者可通过在受影响系统上执行特制的恶意代码，利用该内存处理漏洞将低权限账户权限提升至系统级最高权限（SYSTEM）。该漏洞影响 Windows 7、Windows 8.1、Windows 10 以及 Windows Server 2008/2012/2016/2019 等多个版本。攻击条件要求攻击者拥有本地低权限访问权限，成功利用后可实现对目标系统的完全控制。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-8611"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-12-12T00:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:05:11Z","remediation":"建议立即安装微软 2018 年 12 月发布的累积安全更新（针对各版本 Windows 操作系统），或通过 Windows Update 自动升级到最新补丁版本。对于无法立即更新的系统，建议限制本地低权限用户的执行权限，以降低攻击者利用该漏洞提升至内核权限的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/106082","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2018-8611","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-8611","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-8611.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/d808dcfadcd0a0911218bbebd828dbae55c16a3e/2018/CVE-2018-8611.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e7eb023b782298741349c34d7e1f5ea1ecb3d73d/cves/2018/8xxx/CVE-2018-8611.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d39b6ea8bd1db5015fd4719557f42ea872f89939/2018/8xxx/CVE-2018-8611.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-8611.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-8611.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/13b4b6847c146245cb34369c97e37afd6dfad908/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-8611.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/13b4b6847c146245cb34369c97e37afd6dfad908/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-8611.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/94a1ad649f88b31076fc17ad6fb064050b6da4c2/CVEs/2018/CVE-2018-8611.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-8611.json","https://github.com/lsw29475/CVE-2018-8611"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0034.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0609","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0609.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-20062","title":"NoneCms ThinkPHP 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"NoneCms V1.3 及更早版本中的 thinkphp/library/think/App.php 存在远程命令执行漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求，利用 filter 参数传递恶意函数名（如 phpinfo），配合 data 参数传入参数值，实现任意 PHP 代码执行。该漏洞影响 NoneCms ≤1.3 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。官方至今未发布修复补丁，建议用户迁移至其他 CMS 系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-20062"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-12-11T18:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:52:14Z","remediation":"NoneCms 已停止维护，官方未发布修复补丁。建议立即迁移至其他受支持的 CMS 平台；如无法迁移，需在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面拦截包含 filter 参数的 HTTP 请求，或手动修改 thinkphp/library/think/App.php 中 filter 参数的处理逻辑，禁止外部用户传入 filter 参数，同时限制 data 参数的可接受值范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157218/ThinkPHP-5.0.23-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://github.com/nangge/noneCms/issues/21","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-20062","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-20062.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-20062.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/0cbbfd20018b392e9b69a82c4ac1297203bfeefd/2018/CVE-2018-20062.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c908bbff86d2944f8f8a39e75f549a966c642420/2018/CVE-2018-20062.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/ed3533775a9ade21f1577e57c130e65e8f80898c/2018/CVE-2018-20062.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-20062.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-20062.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-20062.json","https://github.com/CharanRayudu/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/6418cf9ac43a7d4121d979ae9afb12f54511729e/CVE-2018-20062.yaml","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2018/CVE-2018-20062.md","https://github.com/crowdsecurity/hub/blob/b462c9cd0d28b2eeb23f29c6058d091a22f703a2/scenarios/crowdsecurity/thinkphp-cve-2018-20062.yaml","https://github.com/NS-Sp4ce/thinkphp5.XRce","https://github.com/yilin1203/CVE-2018-20062","https://github.com/shenhui35/RedArrow"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0609.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0506","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0506.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-17480","title":"Google Chrome V8 越界写入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 71.0.3578.80 之前版本的 V8 JavaScript 引擎在数组反序列化过程中存在越界写入漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面，诱使用户访问后触发该漏洞，导致在沙箱环境下执行任意代码。该漏洞影响所有使用 Chrome 71 之前版本的用户，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Google 已在 Chrome 71.0.3578.80 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-17480"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-12-11T16:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:45:56Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 71.0.3578.80 或更高版本，可通过 Chrome 设置 > 关于 Chrome > 自动检查更新完成。基于 Chromium 的浏览器（如 Microsoft Edge、Opera）也需更新至对应修复版本。Debian/Ubuntu 用户执行 `apt update && apt upgrade chromium` 应用 DSA-4352；Red Hat/CentOS 用户应用 RHSA-2018:3803 更新 chromium 包。Gentoo 用户参照 GLSA 201908-18 升级。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，应优先修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/106084","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:3803","https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2018/12/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://crbug.com/905940","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201908-18","https://www.debian.org/security/2018/dsa-4352","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-17480","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-17480.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f167926487b7da90867c80cac87302a7f8196ec5/2018/17xxx/CVE-2018-17480.json","https://github.com/tunz/js-vuln-db/blob/26d3f06008cbf95d05f066d2bf2a220deff491fc/v8/TODO.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-17480.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-17480.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/vex/cve/2018/CVE-2018-17480.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/osv/cve/2018/UBUNTU-CVE-2018-17480.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-17480.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2018-17480","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-17480.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0506.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0106","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0106.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-1000861","title":"Jenkins Stapler Web Framework 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Jenkins 使用的 Stapler Web 框架在 MetaClass.java 中存在 URL 处理缺陷，允许攻击者通过访问精心构造的 URL 来调用 Java 对象的非预期方法。远程未经身份验证的攻击者可以通过向目标发送特制请求触发该漏洞，从而在服务器上执行任意代码，导致系统被完全接管。该漏洞影响 Jenkins 2.153 及其之前的版本，以及 LTS 2.138.3 及其之前的版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-1000861"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-12-10T14:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:33:11Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Jenkins 升级至 2.154 或 LTS 2.138.4 及更高版本。如果无法立即升级，可通过配置严格的访问控制列表（ACL）限制对敏感 URL 的访问，或在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）中拦截包含异常 Java 方法调用特征的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/166778/Jenkins-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/106176","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHBA-2019:0024","https://jenkins.io/security/advisory/2018-12-05/#SECURITY-595","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-1000861","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-1000861.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-1000861.md","https://github.com/fofapro/vulfocus/blob/4b7a2eaacce4ed770f289e6e72f7240da1e16c74/writeup/CVE-2018-1000861/CVE-2018-1000861.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/4d49d726b1fb3c9b2aca31cc43dccec4b6f94cc1/2018/CVE-2018-1000861.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f7fdc93b8d4d470f2c23e4fffbdda828848b6048/2018/CVE-2018-1000861.json","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/中间件漏洞/Jenkins 远程命令执行漏洞 CVE-2018-1000861.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/中间件漏洞/Jenkins checkScript 远程命令执行漏洞 CVE-2018-1000861.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/jenkins/CVE-2018-1000861.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Vulnerability-Wiki/blob/b32b83c01eabac4d6b4b334852be9cff76ba67ee/docs-base/docs/middleware/Jenkins远程命令执行漏洞-CVE-2018-1000861.md","https://github.com/orleven/Tentacle/blob/bc01b3d0d2f9a6117132f40e9098a16180335454/script/vul/jenkins/CVE-2018-1000861.py","https://github.com/lal0ne/vulnerability/blob/5b9f397c1970203b1764fb7a66a0ffac39bef4cc/Jenkins/CVE-2018-1000861/README.md","https://github.com/1NTheKut/CVE-2019-1003000_RCE-DETECTION","https://github.com/smokeintheshell/CVE-2018-1000861"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0106.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0161","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0161.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-20011","title":"DomainMOD 4.11.01 assets/add/category.php 跨站脚本攻击","description":"DomainMOD 4.11.01 版本中的 assets/add/category.php 页面存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。具有管理员权限的攻击者可在\"分类名称\"（Category Name）或\"利益相关者\"（Stakeholder）字段中注入恶意脚本代码，当其他管理员访问受影响页面时脚本自动执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞需高权限用户交互触发，CVSS 评分 4.8，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-20011"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-12-10T09:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:52:09Z","remediation":"升级 DomainMOD 至 4.12.0 或更高版本，该版本已对 category.php 中 Category Name 和 Stakeholder 字段进行输入转义处理。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）层面添加 WAF 规则，拦截包含 `<script>`、`onerror=` 等 XSS 载荷的 POST 请求到 `/assets/add/category.php` 路径，同时启用 Content-Security-Policy 响应头限制内联脚本执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/domainmod/domainmod/issues/88","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46374/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46374","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-20011.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-20011.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-20011.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-20011.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-20011.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2018/20xxx/CVE-2018-20011.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/5784554659c9500df8525e8db4f986630a56d8a1/plugins/domainmod/domainmod/CVE-2018-20011.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-20011.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-20011/poc/nuclei/CVE-2018-20011.yaml","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-20011.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-20011.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0161.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0161.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0160","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0160.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-20010","title":"DomainMOD 4.11.01 ssl-provider-account.php 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"DomainMOD 4.11.01 版本中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，位于 `assets/add/ssl-provider-account.php` 页面的 `username` 参数中。具有管理员权限的攻击者可将恶意 JavaScript 代码注入该参数，当其他管理员访问受影响页面时脚本自动执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。攻击需管理员权限及用户交互，CVSS 评分 4.8，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-20010"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-12-10T09:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:52:09Z","remediation":"升级 DomainMOD 至 4.12.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 ssl-provider-account.php 中 username 参数未正确转义导致的 XSS 问题。如无法立即升级，在应用入口处对 username 等用户输入参数实施 HTML 实体编码（如将 `<` 转义为 `&lt;`），并启用 Content-Security-Policy 响应头限制脚本执行来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/domainmod/domainmod/issues/88","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46373/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46373","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-20010.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-20010.md","https://github.com/projectdiscove