dit/host.php 页面存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。具有管理员权限的认证攻击者可通过向 Web Host Name 或 Web Host URL 字段提交特制的恶意脚本，当其他管理员用户访问该编辑页面时，恶意脚本将在浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞需攻击者具备高权限且需用户交互，CVSS 评分 4.8，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-19915"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-12-06T19:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:50:06Z","remediation":"升级 DomainMOD 至 4.11.02 或更高版本，该版本已修复 assets/edit/host.php 中 Web Host Name 和 Web Host URL 字段的输入过滤缺陷。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）层面添加 WAF 规则，对 /assets/edit/host.php 的 whid 参数进行输入校验，过滤 <script> 等危险字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/domainmod/domainmod/issues/87","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46376/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46376","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19915.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-19915.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19915.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-19915.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-19915.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2018/19xxx/CVE-2018-19915.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/dce139c84c439e9fc87d0eb2079ddda89aaeb75c/plugins/domainmod/domainmod/CVE-2018-19915.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-19915.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-19915/poc/nuclei/CVE-2018-19915.yaml","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-19915.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-19915.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0158.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0158.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0157","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0157.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-19914","title":"DomainMOD up to 4.11.01 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"DomainMOD 4.11.01 及之前版本中存在跨站脚本漏洞，位于 `assets/add/dns.php` 页面的 Profile Name 或 notes 字段。由于程序未对用户输入进行充分过滤和转义，拥有管理员权限的认证攻击者可构造恶意 JavaScript 载荷注入这些字段。当其他管理员用户访问该页面时，恶意脚本将在浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。攻击需高权限认证且依赖用户交互，CVSS 评分 4.8，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-19914"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-12-06T19:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:50:06Z","remediation":"升级 DomainMOD 至 4.11.02 及以上版本，该版本已修复 assets/add/dns.php 中 Profile Name 和 notes 字段的 XSS 漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在服务器端对这两个输入字段实施严格的 HTML 实体编码转义（如 PHP 的 htmlspecialchars($input, ENT_QUOTES, 'UTF-8')），并配置 WAF 规则拦截包含 `<script>` 等危险标签的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/domainmod/domainmod/issues/87","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46375/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46375","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19914.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-19914.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19914.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-19914.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-19914.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2018/19xxx/CVE-2018-19914.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/dce139c84c439e9fc87d0eb2079ddda89aaeb75c/plugins/domainmod/domainmod/CVE-2018-19914.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-19914.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-19914/poc/nuclei/CVE-2018-19914.yaml","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-19914.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-19914.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0157.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0157.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0156","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0156.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-19892","title":"DomainMod DomainMOD 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"DomainMOD 4.11.01及之前版本的后台管理页面 admin/dw/add-server.php 中存在存储型跨站脚本漏洞。具有管理员权限的认证攻击者可在添加服务器时，通过 DisplayName、HostName 或 UserName 字段注入未经过滤的恶意 JavaScript 代码，该代码被存储后将在服务器列表页面执行，导致受害管理员浏览器中执行任意脚本，可能造成会话劫持、敏感信息窃取或页面篡改。攻击者需先获取管理后台登录凭据方可利用，CVSS 评分 4.8，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-19892"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-12-06T03:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:50:04Z","remediation":"立即升级到 DomainMOD v4.12.0 或更高版本（当前最新为 v4.23.0），该版本已修复 admin/dw/add-server.php 中 DisplayName、HostName、UserName 字段的存储型 XSS 问题。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面添加 WAF 规则，对上述三个输入字段过滤 HTML 标签和 JavaScript 关键字，同时在 PHP 配置中启用 htmlspecialchars 对所有用户输入输出进行转义处理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/domainmod/domainmod/issues/85","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19892.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-19892.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19892.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-19892.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2018/19xxx/CVE-2018-19892.json","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-19892.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/dce139c84c439e9fc87d0eb2079ddda89aaeb75c/plugins/domainmod/domainmod/CVE-2018-19892.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-19892.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-19892/poc/nuclei/CVE-2018-19892.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-19892.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/CVE-2018-19892.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0156.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0156.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0156.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0154","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0154.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-19753","title":"Tarantella Enterprise 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Tarantella Enterprise 3.11 之前版本中存在目录遍历漏洞，位于 `/tarantella/cgi-bin/secure/ttawlogin.cgi` 脚本中。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 `pg` 参数传入 `../../` 等路径穿越序列，绕过访问限制读取服务器上的任意文件（如 `/etc/passwd`），导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞无需任何权限即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，影响 Oracle Tarantella Enterprise 全系列 3.11 以下版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-19753"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-12-05T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:49:48Z","remediation":"该产品已由 Oracle 终止支持（EOL），官方不再提供安全更新。建议立即升级到 Tarantella Enterprise 3.11 或更高版本（如仍可获得）；若无法升级，应在 Web 服务器或反向代理层配置访问控制规则，限制对 `/tarantella/cgi-bin/secure/ttawlogin.cgi` 的访问，仅允许可信 IP 段访问，并部署 WAF 规则拦截包含 `../` 或 `./` 路径遍历特征的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/150541/Tarantella-Enterprise-Directory-Traversal.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2018/Nov/66","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19753.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-19753.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19753.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-19753.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-19753-3488.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-19753-3486.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-19753-3487.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/LFI/CVE-2018-19753.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2018/19xxx/CVE-2018-19753.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-19753.js","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19753.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0154.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0155","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0155.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-19877","title":"Adiscon LogAnalyzer 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Adiscon LogAnalyzer 4.1.7 之前版本的 login.php 中存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞。攻击者可通过向登录页面的 Referer 字段中注入恶意 JavaScript 代码，当管理员或用户点击特制的登录按钮时，浏览器会执行攻击者构造的恶意脚本，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，但需要用户交互（点击链接），CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。升级至 4.1.7 及以上版本即可修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-19877"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-12-05T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:50:02Z","remediation":"升级到 Adiscon LogAnalyzer 4.1.7 或更高版本。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）层面添加 WAF 规则过滤 Referer 头中的恶意脚本代码，或对 login.php 的 Referer 参数进行输入验证和输出编码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://loganalyzer.adiscon.com/news/loganalyzer-v4-1-7-v4-stable-released/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45958/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45958","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19877.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-19877.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19877.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-19877.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-19877.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2018/19xxx/CVE-2018-19877.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/dce139c84c439e9fc87d0eb2079ddda89aaeb75c/plugins/adiscon/loganalyzer/CVE-2018-19877.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-19877.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-19877/poc/nuclei/CVE-2018-19877.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2018-19877.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder2/cve-2018-19877.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0155.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0153","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0153.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-19752","title":"DomainMOD 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"DomainMOD 至 4.11.01 版本中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，位于 assets/add/registrar.php 页面的 notes 字段。具有管理员权限的认证攻击者可通过向该字段注入恶意脚本代码，当其他管理员用户访问受影响页面时脚本自动执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。攻击需高权限且需用户交互，CVSS 评分 4.8，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-19752"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-11-29T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:49:47Z","remediation":"升级 DomainMOD 至 v4.12.0 或更高版本，该版本已添加 Sanitize 类对用户输入进行过滤，并增加了 XSS 验证防护。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加规则，对 assets/add/registrar.php 的 notes 参数进行输入过滤和输出编码，阻止未转义的 HTML/JavaScript 提交。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/domainmod/domainmod/issues/84","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45949/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45949","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19752.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-19752.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19752.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-19752.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-19752.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2018/19xxx/CVE-2018-19752.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/dce139c84c439e9fc87d0eb2079ddda89aaeb75c/plugins/domainmod/domainmod/CVE-2018-19752.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-19752.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-19752/poc/nuclei/CVE-2018-19752.yaml","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-19752.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-19752.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0153.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0153.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0153.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0152","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0152.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-19751","title":"DomainMOD 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"DomainMOD 4.11.01 及之前版本的管理后台中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，位于 admin/ssl-fields/add.php 页面的 notes 字段。具有管理员权限的认证用户可通过向该字段注入恶意 JavaScript 代码触发漏洞，导致存储型 XSS。当其他管理员访问受影响页面时，恶意脚本会在浏览器中执行，造成敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。攻击者需具备管理员权限且需诱使用户交互，CVSS 评分 4.8，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-19751"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-11-29T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:49:47Z","remediation":"升级 DomainMOD 至 4.12.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 admin/ssl-fields/add.php 中 notes 字段的 XSS 问题。如无法升级，在服务器端对 notes 字段输入进行 HTML 实体编码过滤，并配置 Content-Security-Policy 响应头限制脚本执行。同时限制仅受信任的高权限用户访问 SSL 字段管理页面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/domainmod/domainmod/issues/83","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45947/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45947","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19751.yaml","https://github.com