06-17T01:49:47Z","remediation":"升级 DomainMOD 至 v4.12.0 或更高版本（当前最新为 v4.23.0），该版本已对用户输入进行转义处理，可有效防御 XSS 攻击。如无法立即升级，可在 `assets/add/account-owner.php` 中对 Owner name 字段使用 `htmlspecialchars()` 或 `strip_tags()` 进行输出编码，并启用 HTTP 响应头 `X-XSS-Protection: 1; mode=block` 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/domainmod/domainmod/issues/81","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45941/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45941","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19749.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-19749.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19749.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-19749.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-19749.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2018/19xxx/CVE-2018-19749.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/dce139c84c439e9fc87d0eb2079ddda89aaeb75c/plugins/domainmod/domainmod/CVE-2018-19749.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-19749.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-19749/poc/nuclei/CVE-2018-19749.yaml","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-19749.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-19749.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0151.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://gi